  "description": "Pay composition test cases for reference/premium_stacking_reference.py and the TypeScript engine. Each case starts from version 1 of rules/agreements/example-municipal-agreement.json (Clerk 2 step 3, $30.85/h), applies the overrides (objects merge, lists replace, null removes a key), and composes one block of hours.",
